-- =============================================================================
-- Liv Finder — demo seed · inquiries, messages, favourites, saved searches, bookings, offers, reviews
-- =============================================================================
-- Plain SQL. Edit it directly; there is no generator behind it.
-- Regenerate with:  python3 db/tools/build_demo_seed.py
--
-- Leads and everything that follows from them.
-- 
-- Inquiry statuses are distributed the way a real pipeline is — most new
-- or contacted, a minority qualified, a small tail won or lost. The
-- per-status counts that the portal inbox tabs display are COUNTs over
-- these rows, so a tab label can never promise more than it shows.
-- 
-- Every inquiry is also recorded in the analytics rollups (046) on the
-- day it arrived, so listing.inquiry_count, listing_daily_stats and the
-- inquiries table all agree.
-- =============================================================================

